,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2933.349562992,"data":" Once upon a time, there was a little girl named Lily. She loved to play outside in the sunshine. One day, she was playing on the lawn when she saw an unusual enjoying the sunshine. It was so pretty and pretty. \n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2933.34957169,"data":"Lily decided to follow the butterfly and see where it landed. She followed the butterfly until it flew away. When she got back to her house, she saw that it was actually a rabbit hopping around. The rabbit didn't have a home, Lily was sad that she couldn't play with it anymore.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2933.349578207,"data":"\u003c|endoftext|\u003e\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2933.349584147,"data":"Once upon a time, there was a little girl named Lily. She loved to play outside in the park with her friends. One day, they decided to have a picnic under a big tree.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2933.349589817,"data":"While they were eating their picnic, Lily's friend asked, \"What are we eating?\"\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2933.34959494,"data":"\"We're eating yummy snacks!\" Lily exclaimed.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2933.349600087,"data":"\"I know, but we can't eat it now,\" her friend said.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2933.349607027,"data":"Lily was sad, but she didn't want to share. She started to walk towards her friends, but she was nowhere to be found. Her friends searched and searched, but they couldn't find her.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2933.349616027,"data":"Lily was feeling very upset because the picnic was too thick and it was too late. She missed her friends and felt very bitter. Her friends were very sad that they couldn't have fun together, but they could still have fun.\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":2933.349619935,"data":"\u003c|endoftext|\u003e\n"}
